WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.921
Anansi the Spider sat in a tall tree, watching Goat work in his garden.

2
00:00:07.921 --> 00:00:12.481
"Goat's melons look delicious!" thought Anansi.

3
00:00:12.481 --> 00:00:19.317
The spider loved fruit, but he was too lazy to grow anything himself.

4
00:00:19.317 --> 00:00:23.702
When Goat left, Anansi dropped into the garden.

5
00:00:23.703 --> 00:00:27.670
With a thorn, he carved a hole in a melon.

6
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:33.872
He crawled inside, and began to eat—and eat and eat!

7
00:00:33.873 --> 00:00:36.890
Anansi rubbed his full belly.

8
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.120
"Goat will be back soon," he said.

9
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.958
"I must go."

10
00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:45.325
He tried to crawl out through the hole.

11
00:00:45.325 --> 00:00:48.063
But now he was too fat!

12
00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:51.269
"I'll wait until I'm thin again."

13
00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:54.929
Anansi grew bored while he waited.

14
00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:59.130
When Goat returned, Anansi got an idea.

15
00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:04.625
He loved to play tricks—he could trick Goat!

16
00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:07.127
Goat picked up the melon.

17
00:01:07.127 --> 00:01:10.112
"Ow!" Anansi yelped.

18
00:01:10.112 --> 00:01:14.788
"Who said that?" Goat cried, looking around.

19
00:01:14.788 --> 00:01:18.419
"Me," replied the melon.

20
00:01:18.419 --> 00:01:22.080
Goat blinked. "Melons can't talk!"

21
00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:24.945
"Yes, we can."

22
00:01:24.945 --> 00:01:28.440
"This is incredible!" said Goat.

23
00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.550
"I must show the queen!"

24
00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:33.981
He hurried toward the palace.

25
00:01:33.982 --> 00:01:36.157
Rattlesnake saw him.

26
00:01:36.157 --> 00:01:39.606
"Where are you going?" she called.

27
00:01:39.607 --> 00:01:45.302
"I'm taking this melon to the queen," replied Goat. "It talks."

28
00:01:45.302 --> 00:01:52.326
"That's silly." Rattlesnake laughed. "As silly as—"

29
00:01:52.327 --> 00:01:56.132
"A kind rattlesnake!" said the melon.

30
00:01:56.131 --> 00:02:01.989
Rattlesnake scowled. "Who said that?"

31
00:02:01.989 --> 00:02:06.543
"I told you—this melon talks!" said Goat.

32
00:02:06.544 --> 00:02:09.396
"Amazing!" said Rattlesnake.

33
00:02:09.396 --> 00:02:12.272
"I'll go with you."

34
00:02:12.273 --> 00:02:15.539
Goat and Rattlesnake headed toward the palace.

35
00:02:15.539 --> 00:02:18.789
More animals heard the melon talking.

36
00:02:18.789 --> 00:02:22.871
They followed Goat and Rattlesnake to the palace.

37
00:02:22.872 --> 00:02:28.917
Goat bowed. "Your Majesty, we brought you a melon."

38
00:02:28.917 --> 00:02:33.961
The queen frowned. "I already have plenty of melons."

39
00:02:33.961 --> 00:02:38.688
"This melon is unique," explained Goat proudly.

40
00:02:38.688 --> 00:02:40.868
"It can talk!"

41
00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:43.551
The queen stepped closer.

42
00:02:43.552 --> 00:02:46.614
"Speak, melon!" she ordered.

43
00:02:46.614 --> 00:02:50.290
But the melon stayed quiet.

44
00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:54.543
"Melon! I order you to speak!"

45
00:02:54.543 --> 00:02:57.614
Still, the melon was silent.

46
00:02:57.614 --> 00:03:01.633
"What a silly melon!" the queen snapped.

47
00:03:01.633 --> 00:03:04.791
"Silly?" echoed the melon.

48
00:03:04.791 --> 00:03:08.013
"You're the one who's talking to a melon!"

49
00:03:08.013 --> 00:03:11.566
The queen's face turned bright red.

50
00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:16.627
She picked up the melon and flung it with all her might.

51
00:03:16.627 --> 00:03:22.413
The melon hit a tree in Goat's garden and shattered into pieces.

52
00:03:22.413 --> 00:03:25.874
Anansi crawled out of the melon.

53
00:03:25.874 --> 00:03:29.040
"I'm thin again!" he said happily.

54
00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:34.034
"I'm hungry too." He scurried up a nearby banana tree.

55
00:03:34.034 --> 00:03:37.530
Goat returned to his garden.

56
00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:41.760
"Dumb melons! I'm never listening to you again!"

57
00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.040
"Good idea," called a banana.

58
00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:50.149
"Talking melons always bring trouble!"

